  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a polymath who achieves excellence in every field to which you devote yourself.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Multitalented Mastery<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> In addition to gaining either 1 hit point or 1 skill point per level, you also gain the favored class bonus for whichever class level you select. If you have the Elven Spirit or Human Spirit feat, you may select the favored class bonus for that race rather than for half-elves.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc93\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
